WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.270
Brought to you by Guodong Subs

00:00:10.470 --> 00:00:13.600
We do not own the copyright. Only for academic exchange purpose.
Welcome to watch it on the official channel

00:00:19.870 --> 00:00:22.660
It's my first time visiting such a big hotel.

00:00:22.870 --> 00:00:27.120
I never realized, the night is so beautiful from here!

00:00:30.450 --> 00:00:32.870
What you can see is just the surface.

00:00:33.160 --> 00:00:36.200
Most of the parts are full of darkness.

00:00:36.990 --> 00:00:41.330
Then do you know what is happening in the darkness right now?

00:00:42.330 --> 00:00:43.490
I don't know

00:00:44.160 --> 00:00:47.830
That's it. Just look what you can see.

00:00:50.450 --> 00:00:51.540
Naive!

00:00:55.990 --> 00:00:58.330
I know there are darkness all around the world.

00:00:58.910 --> 00:01:03.200
angry and even desperate are happening right now.
There are lots of things that can make people

00:01:04.200 --> 00:01:07.290
If cultivation can let one to gain such great power -

00:01:07.720 --> 00:01:11.240
then why not use this power to help those in darkness?

00:01:11.950 --> 00:01:13.490
it is possible, right?

00:01:22.950 --> 00:01:24.080
It's not so easy.

00:01:32.240 --> 00:01:33.660
Are we going to training here?

00:01:36.910 --> 00:01:38.370
What should I do?

00:01:39.200 --> 00:01:41.660
You want the fastest route or the slow and steady route?

00:01:42.080 --> 00:01:43.580
Of course, the fastest route.

00:01:44.160 --> 00:01:46.080
Then jump from here.

00:01:47.330 --> 00:01:51.370
Humans usually unlock their hidden potential, when they face grave dangers.

00:01:52.120 --> 00:01:55.910
As long as you desire to live, you'll bound to awaken your power.

00:01:58.220 --> 00:01:59.040
and if I fail?

00:01:59.410 --> 00:02:04.410
There will be news on tomorrow morning newspaper, that a university
security guard had committed suicide.

00:02:05.660 --> 00:02:07.370
You are so naive, anyway -

00:02:07.560 --> 00:02:08.930
if you don't awaken your powers quickly..

00:02:09.080 --> 00:02:09.950
You'll surely

00:02:10.120 --> 00:02:12.370
be killed by other cultivators practitioners sooner or later~

00:02:12.580 --> 00:02:14.870
Therefore, it's better to make a try~

00:02:15.490 --> 00:02:17.160
This girl is definitely taking revenge on me.

00:02:28.290 --> 00:02:29.910
I don't want to die.

00:02:30.990 --> 00:02:33.120
You only have one chance!

00:02:34.740 --> 00:02:35.120
Wait!

00:02:36.580 --> 00:02:38.660
See you later.

00:02:43.540 --> 00:02:45.290
The power that saved the girl, that day -

00:02:46.200 --> 00:02:47.830
As long as I can use that power again..

00:02:48.410 --> 00:02:50.620
Power! Power!

00:02:55.990 --> 00:02:58.080
What exactly should I do?

00:03:05.700 --> 00:03:07.790
I'm really gonna die!

00:03:09.830 --> 00:03:11.080
I can't do this.

00:03:12.950 --> 00:03:13.990
Am i..

00:03:14.700 --> 00:03:15.740
really gonna die?

00:03:40.370 --> 00:03:40.830
You...

00:03:41.990 --> 00:03:44.870
This is our life and death moment~

00:04:32.540 --> 00:04:34.080
It's beautiful,right?

00:04:36.910 --> 00:04:37.750
You Idiot!

00:04:39.970 --> 00:04:44.350
We don't need to take plane now, right? We can just fly there.

00:05:04.890 --> 00:05:06.720
Don't get too carried away!

00:05:08.930 --> 00:05:11.350
Everything thing has a price.

00:05:11.470 --> 00:05:12.770
Price?

00:05:14.220 --> 00:05:17.810
Modern cultivation world is like a forest which lacks of resources.

00:05:18.220 --> 00:05:21.140
Cultivators are starving beast living in this forest.

00:05:22.180 --> 00:05:24.220
They hide in darkness -

00:05:24.560 --> 00:05:26.100
in order to

00:05:26.140 --> 00:05:29.930
make a kind of balance that nobody knows where they are.

00:05:30.600 --> 00:05:31.680
If one day,

00:05:32.350 --> 00:05:34.310
someone make a bonfire that

00:05:34.640 --> 00:05:38.390
light up the whole forest and let others out of hiding.

00:05:39.390 --> 00:05:41.470
What do you think they will do?

00:05:41.520 --> 00:05:43.470
Gather around the bonfire for warmth?

00:05:44.180 --> 00:05:45.180
They won't!

00:05:45.680 --> 00:05:48.140
This idiot may do something more stupid in future.

00:05:48.810 --> 00:05:51.270
Who knows? What will happen?

00:05:51.310 --> 00:05:53.310
Rather than letting him continue to waste the forest's precious resources,

00:05:53.640 --> 00:05:55.930
It's better to kill him now,

00:05:56.060 --> 00:05:57.140
while he is still weak.

00:06:03.060 --> 00:06:05.930
If you dare to expose yourself next time,

00:06:06.350 --> 00:06:09.390
it won't be me that you'll face but others.

00:06:14.040 --> 00:06:16.370
That moving spirit energy appeared again.

00:06:16.750 --> 00:06:19.750
In just half a day, it went to Level Zhuji (Foundation Building)

00:06:20.160 --> 00:06:20.910
Interesting.

00:06:21.120 --> 00:06:21.790
Ru Yue

00:06:24.040 --> 00:06:25.750
What are your orders, Master?

00:06:25.950 --> 00:06:28.160
Find the owner of that power fluctuation who cased this

00:06:28.160 --> 00:06:29.660
and test his strength.

00:06:30.040 --> 00:06:30.910
Remember,

00:06:31.290 --> 00:06:32.370
keep a low profile.

00:06:33.040 --> 00:06:36.000
If he is just a weakling with low cultivation level,

00:06:36.040 --> 00:06:36.830
Then -

00:06:36.870 --> 00:06:38.450
Kill him!

00:06:39.040 --> 00:06:40.250
Yes, Master.

00:06:59.450 --> 00:07:01.950
Muzi, you finally come back~

00:07:02.290 --> 00:07:05.250
Senior, you didn't wait for a whole day, did you?

00:07:05.790 --> 00:07:09.410
Its only natural for a gentlemen to wait for the lady~...about watching the movie.

00:07:11.910 --> 00:07:14.790
I'm sorry, Senior. We just came back from hotel.

00:07:15.120 --> 00:07:18.810
I'm so tired, Let's go another day.

00:07:19.410 --> 00:07:20.950
Ho..Hotel?

00:07:21.500 --> 00:07:24.250
Muzi slept with this guy?!

00:07:24.330 --> 00:07:25.870
and she's very tired?

00:07:30.580 --> 00:07:30.910
You Bastard!!!

00:07:31.540 --> 00:07:33.330
I'll kill you!

00:07:38.750 --> 00:07:40.330
Mu...Muzi?

00:07:42.700 --> 00:07:46.200
Only I can beat my man. You, get out of my sight!

00:07:48.330 --> 00:07:49.830
Let's go, Ying Xiong.

00:07:50.160 --> 00:07:50.700
Ok.

00:08:01.200 --> 00:08:02.080
What?

00:08:02.450 --> 00:08:05.410
You're still using this old fashioned phone?

00:08:05.830 --> 00:08:07.540
You can't even use WeChat in this!

00:08:10.450 --> 00:08:12.830
It is enough to send messages.

00:08:13.040 --> 00:08:14.290
Enough? my foot!

00:08:16.080 --> 00:08:16.450
Take this!

00:08:20.620 --> 00:08:22.040
I'll be contacting you via WeChat,

00:08:22.450 --> 00:08:23.580
make sure you replay as soon as you get!

00:08:25.970 --> 00:08:26.770
This is..

00:08:27.270 --> 00:08:28.520
A Love Phone~

00:08:29.330 --> 00:08:32.080
I'm really happy!

00:08:35.000 --> 00:08:36.250
Muzi.

00:08:38.410 --> 00:08:41.200
I've been troubled by a question all this time..

00:08:42.250 --> 00:08:43.250
What question?

00:08:43.750 --> 00:08:46.160
You said weaklings can only hide themselves

00:08:46.580 --> 00:08:48.250
from being killed by strong practitioners.

00:08:48.750 --> 00:08:51.290
Muzi, you're also a practitioners, right?

00:08:51.620 --> 00:08:53.700
Why didn't you kill me?

00:08:54.660 --> 00:08:55.700
That is because

00:08:56.200 --> 00:08:57.910
You absorbed a large portion of my spirit energy.

00:08:59.370 --> 00:09:00.540
If I kill you,

00:09:01.120 --> 00:09:02.910
the spirit energy will also disappear.

00:09:03.620 --> 00:09:07.660
Those spirit energy only can be transferred by the unique method of my family.

00:09:08.700 --> 00:09:10.120
Otherwise,

00:09:10.160 --> 00:09:13.250
I won't have asked you to cultivate with me.

00:09:15.790 --> 00:09:17.950
Wait, one more question

00:09:19.120 --> 00:09:20.660
Why so many?

00:09:25.160 --> 00:09:28.000
Can we cultivate tonight?

00:09:29.750 --> 00:09:31.250
Are you serious?

00:09:33.910 --> 00:09:35.580
N..No. Just Kidding!

00:09:35.580 --> 00:09:36.950
Ha-Ha....

00:09:37.000 --> 00:09:38.580
If there is nothing else, I'll go back to work.

00:09:48.040 --> 00:09:49.750
Let's start from by holding hands!

00:09:51.250 --> 00:09:52.790
Although Muzi said,

00:09:53.330 --> 00:09:55.410
that how cruel the cultivation world is..

00:09:56.000 --> 00:09:59.330
But somehow i feel warm from being with her.

00:10:15.290 --> 00:10:18.330
The taste of blood is really good.

00:10:23.100 --> 00:10:29.790
It's the whisper of waves
Waken at nightfall

00:10:29.810 --> 00:10:35.560
The scenery outside the window is dyed red by the afterglow

00:10:36.830 --> 00:10:43.910
Blank mood
Scattered time

00:10:43.910 --> 00:10:48.660
No one is along with me to the dawn time

00:10:49.970 --> 00:10:57.000
Ear is listening
Wind is passed

00:10:57.020 --> 00:11:02.580
Could I hear the sound of your heart beat?

00:11:03.430 --> 00:11:10.580
Let this wind blows hair to the air

00:11:10.600 --> 00:11:17.370
Bit bit drops into my heart
Pitter-patter is perpetual

00:11:17.390 --> 00:11:24.370
Rose in the vase rises her white body sideways

00:11:24.390 --> 00:11:29.500
It rejects of dying alone

00:11:31.200 --> 00:11:45.060
